5964..6040 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
6041..6115 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6116..6192 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6193..6267 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6268..6276 Comment "/// `g`."
